        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nFind [MATH: |z|] if [MATH: z = \u2212 c \u2212 d\\textrm{i}.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: sqrt(c^{2} + d^{2})]\nb. [MATH: sqrt(c \u2212 d)]\nc. [MATH: sqrt(c + d)]\nd. [MATH: sqrt(c^{2} \u2212 d^{2})]\ne. [MATH: sqrt(c^{2})sqrt(d^{2})]"
